    "updated_at": "2018-02-19T14:12:15Z",
    "body": "This seems hard to fix. We cannot just run \"insertion steps\" twice since there'd be too many side effects for other elements. The simplest thing I can think of is keeping track of inserted HTML/SVG script elements and then invoking their insertion algorithm at the end of https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node-insert.",
