    "created_at": "2018-02-19T14:59:52Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-02-19T14:59:52Z",
    "body": "I looked at Firefox's code in https://github.com/whatwg/dom/issues/575 and it seems any notifications happen after all nodes are inserted, which seems reasonable. I haven't quite investigated if any scripts executing at that point can mess things up though.\r\n\r\n(I also found that Safari is alone in reporting different numbers for the test, but hopefully they're willing to align.)",
