    "created_at": "2018-02-21T15:02:43Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-02-21T15:02:43Z",
    "body": "> In WebKit, we create a queue of \"tasks\" (e.g. firing events, adding a new stylesheet) while inserting nodes\r\n\r\nFWIW, that sounds very similar to Gecko. We call these tasks ScriptRunners.",
